Composite: When I verify main application page
Given I am on main application page
When I wait until element located by `caseSensitiveText(Swag Labs)` appears
Then `${current-page-url}` is equal to `https://www.saucedemo.com/`
When I take screenshot

Composite: When I log in as $username
Given I am on main application page
When I enter `<username>` in field located `xpath(//input[@id="user-name"])` using keyboard
When I enter `${swagPassword}` in field located `xpath(//input[@id="password"])` using keyboard
When I click on a button with the name 'Login'
